            "review_title": "Review at 5 Muoi",
            "review_text": "mvanroy\nMerelbeke, Belgium883 contributions\n0\nTasty lunch with an authentic Street-Food Vibe near the war museum\nJul 2026 • Family\nOn our way to the War Museum, we decided on the spur of the moment to stop here for lunch. Only afterwards did we read the less favorable reviews, most of which were quite old. In hindsight, that was probably for the best, as we actually enjoyed our meal.\n\nWe ordered the fresh spring rolls and the banh xeo. While these weren’t the best we’ve ever had - the banh xeo, for example, was a little on the greasy side - they were still tasty and fit-for-purpose for a quick lunch.\n\nThe restaurant has an authentic street-food vibe, and the staff were friendly and welcoming. Overall, a pleasant experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 3, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
