            "review_text": "Tim G\nTay Ninh, Vietnam80 contributions\n0\nChanged my mind!\nMar 2021 • Solo\nWrote a review for this place back in October 2019 and I gave an honest review. Unfortunately, I’ve been back since - I had to change my mind and experience. Local food is OK, any “western food” is terrible. The service is virtually non existent. Wait staff doesn’t greet you nor wait on you. You have to ask for a menu, you have to ask for a drink, you have to ask for a refill, you have to ask for the check. The staff NEVER makes eye contact with you. Manager said the reason service is this way is because staff is embarrassed that they don’t speak English. Don’t bother, there are plenty of other decent restaurants in HCMC, although many of them have similar issues.\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2021",
