            "review_text": "Rob A\n4 contributions\n0\nDreadful- STAY AWAY\nJan 2019 • Family\nWe came here looking for a light lunch, a couple of fresh spring roles and drinks...ended up being the most expensive meal of the whole trip. They tie you a card with the food on it and don’t tell you the prices and because you’re a tourist, they obviously charge you a lot more. We paid £4 for a plate of 3 very average spring roles, and £2 (!!!) for a drink. At least 4x the price of anywhere else we’ve been.\nReally poor service, the woman employee refused to give us a contact card when we asked what the name of the restaurant was to complain. DO NOT COME HERE AS THEY OVERCHARGE SIGNIFICANTLY\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 24, 2019",
